  "title": "RideNow Group, Inc. Secures Additional $35 Million In Floorplan Capacity",
  "summary": "CHANDLER, Ariz., May 18, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — RideNow Group, Inc. (NASDAQ: RDNW) today announced a significant expansion of its borrowing capacity, securing an additional $35 million in floorplan financing to support several of its major OEM relationships. The increase brings RideNow’s total credit capacity to approximately $400 million, up significantly from the amount reported at […]",
